// "look" — a 3D LUT, a `.cube` file, over the picture: the grade a colourist or a camera maker
// ships. The NODE names the file, since one look module serves every LUT a song uses:
//
//   nodes/film.k7x
//     extends: "@k7-core/shaders/look"
//     lut: looks/film.cube          # project-relative
//
// P1 is how much of it is laid over the picture, all of it at 1. See packages/song-video/docs/effects.md.
type("shader")
shader("look")
params({
  P1: 1, // strength: 0 the picture as shot, 1 the LUT's look entirely
  P2: 0,
  P3: 0,
  P4: 0,
})
